<BaseLayout title="Workflow Toolkit and Templates | AI Workflow Toolkit" description="Explore practical workflow resources and a growing collection of reusable templates for small teams.">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">The resource shelf</span><h1>Repeatable work starts with <span class="gradient">a useful template.</span></h1><p>A growing collection of practical resources for client delivery and automation. Start with the free generator and guides; paid downloads may be introduced only when the resources are ready.</p></div>
  <div class="cards" style="padding-bottom:45px">
    <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">✓</div><h3>Client onboarding checklist</h3><p>Build a tailored starter checklist, mark completed tasks and export a plain-text copy for your workflow.</p><a class="text-link" href="/onboarding/">Use the free tool →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">↗</div><h3>Automation planning guide</h3><p>Learn how to choose a first process, map its steps and measure whether automation made it better.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/first-workflow-to-automate/">Read the guide →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-icon">◇</div><h3>Safer AI workflow checklist</h3><p>Use practical checks for permissions, verification, failure handling and human approval before an AI workflow goes live.</p><a class="text-link" href="/guides/safer-ai-workflows/">Read the guide →</a></article>
  </div>
  <div class="banner" style="margin-bottom:75px"><div><h2>Have a workflow that keeps slowing you down?</h2><p>Start with the task you repeat most often and turn it into a checklist.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/onboarding/">Build a checklist ↗</a></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
